%% Activity — routine import, validation and publishing
flowchart TD
  A([New semester]) --> B[Teacher hands dept Excel sheet<br/>to department admin]
  B --> C[Admin copies it into the clean template:<br/>Classes, Teachers, Rooms sheets]
  C --> D[Upload template to semester]
  D --> E[Parse rows]
  E --> F{Errors?<br/>unknown teacher or room, missing field,<br/>bad day or time, end before start,<br/>day outside Sun to Thu}
  F -- Yes --> G[Show error list, publish blocked]
  G --> C
  F -- No --> H{Warnings?<br/>teacher, room or section overlap, TBA,<br/>duplicate course+group per day,<br/>before 8:30 or after 17:30}
  H -- Yes --> I[Admin reviews:<br/>confirm combined class or accept]
  I --> J{All accepted?}
  J -- No --> C
  J -- Yes --> K
  H -- No --> K[Preview routine per section]
  K --> L{Re-import for same semester?}
  L -- Yes --> M[Show diff incl. hand-edited slots,<br/>admin chooses what to keep]
  M --> N
  L -- No --> N{Clashes with approved<br/>room bookings?}
  N -- Yes --> O[Warn admin naming requester:<br/>keep class or cancel booking]
  O --> P
  N -- No --> P[Confirm publish]
  P --> Q[Publish: routine visible to<br/>students and teachers]
  Q --> R[Archive previous routine]
  R --> S[Notify affected users; audit log]
  S --> T([End])
